%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 25. Completing a washing-machine program (prompts.md)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> DoorLocked: Start [Door Closed]
    DoorLocked --> Running: Lock Engaged

    state Running {
        [*] --> Filling

        Filling --> Washing: Water Level Reached
        Filling --> Fault: Fill Timeout

        Washing --> Draining: Wash Timer Expired

        Draining --> Rinsing: Water Empty

        Rinsing --> Draining: Rinse Complete / Increment Counter [Rinse Counter < Target]
        Rinsing --> Spinning: Rinse Complete [Rinse Counter >= Target]

        Spinning --> Redistributing: Imbalance Detected
        Redistributing --> Spinning: Load Balanced

        Spinning --> [*]: Spin Timer Expired
    }

    Running --> PausedDraining: Pause [Water Present]
    Running --> PausedReadyToUnlock: Pause [No Water Present]
    Running --> Fault: System Error

    PausedDraining --> PausedReadyToUnlock: Water Empty
    PausedReadyToUnlock --> DoorLocked: Resume [Door Closed]
    PausedReadyToUnlock --> Idle: Door Unlocked

    Running --> Completed: Cycle Finished
    Completed --> Idle: Door Opened

    Fault --> Idle: Reset / Cleared
    Fault --> [*]
